ma Society) Scholar Award, Scholar Achievement Award and The Dattels Family Endowed Chair. J.J.M. was supported by a Blood Cancer United Career Development Program Fellow Award and The Jackson Laboratory Scholar Award. I.F.M. was supported by the Mark Foundation for Cancer Research, a Scholarship of Excellence Rafael del Pino, and an NCI F99 award (<a href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/nuccore/CA284253">CA284253</a>-01). K.S.G. was supported by funding from the ERC under the European Union’s Horizon 2020 Marie Sklodowska-Curie Innovative Training Network (MSCA-ITN, grant agreement no. 953407). A.N.T. is supported by funds from the Canadian Institutes for Health Research (PJT-203948, PJT-180406 to A.N.T.), a Tier II Canadian Research Chair, the Princess Margaret Cancer Foundation and the Ontario Institute for Cancer Research.</p></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="author-information" data-title="Author information"><div class="c-article-section" id="author-information-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="author-information">Author information</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="author-information-content"><h3 class="c-article__sub-heading" id="affiliations">Authors and Affiliations</h3><ol class="c-article-author-affiliation__list"><li id="Aff1"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">The Jackson Laboratory, Bar Harbor, ME, USA</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list">Jayna J. Mistry, Kira A. Young, Patricia A. Colom Díaz, Maria Telpoukhovskaia &amp; Jennifer J. Trowbridge</p></li><li id="Aff2"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">Department of Medicine III, School of Medicine and Health, Technical University of Munich, Munich, Germany</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list">Anna Navarro Figueredo &amp; Katharina S. Götze</p></li><li id="Aff3"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">University Health Network, Princess Margaret Cancer Centre, Toronto, Ontario, Canada</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list">Gibran Edun, Alicia G. Aguilar-Navarro &amp; Anastasia N. Tikhonova</p></li><li id="Aff4"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">Memorial Sloan Kettering Cancer Center, Louis V. Gerstner Jr Graduate School of Biomedical Sciences, New York, NY, USA</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list">Inés Fernández Maestre</p></li><li id="Aff5"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">Human Oncology and Pathogenesis Program, Center for Hematologic Malignancies and Leukemia Service, Department of Medicine, Memorial Sloan Kettering Cancer Center, New York, NY, USA</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list">Inés Fernández Maestre, Sheng F. Cai &amp; Ross L. Levine</p></li><li id="Aff6"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">Bavarian Cancer Research Center (BZKF), Munich, Germany</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list">Katharina S. Götze</p></li><li id="Aff7"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">Department of Medical Biophysics and Department of Immunology, University of Toronto, Toronto, Ontario, Canada</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list">Anastasia N. Tikhonova</p></li><li id="Aff8"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">Ontario Institute for Cancer Research, Toronto, Ontario, Canada</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list">Anastasia N. Tikhonova</p></li></ol><div class="u-js-hide u-hide-print" data-test="author-info"><span class="c-article__sub-heading">Authors</span><ol class="c-article-authors-search u-list-reset"><li id="auth-Jayna_J_-Mistry-Aff1"><span class="c-article-authors-search__title u-h3 js-search-name">Jayna J. Mistry</span><div class="c-article-authors-search__list"><div class="c-article-authors-search__item c-article-authors-search__list-item--left"><a href="/search?author=Jayna%20J.%20Mistry" class="c-article-button" data-trac